Azure mengelola server API,

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:00.260
HCD, scheduler,

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:01.400
dan controller manager.

00:10:01.980 --> 00:10:02.820
Anda tidak perlu khawatir

00:10:02.820 --> 00:10:03.460
tentang menambalnya

00:10:03.460 --> 00:10:04.400
atau menjaganya agar tepat.

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:05.440
Anda hanya membayar

00:10:05.440 --> 00:10:06.160
untuk Node pekerja,

00:10:06.300 --> 00:10:06.900
