serta Azure Policy

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:05.320
untuk tata kelola.

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:06.940
Semuanya bekerja bersama

00:11:06.940 --> 00:11:07.460
secara langsung,

00:11:07.760 --> 00:11:08.540
tanpa perlu menyambungkan

00:11:08.540 --> 00:11:09.100
komponen interface.

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:10.880
Menyiapkan pipeline CI per CD

00:11:10.880 --> 00:11:11.740
dengan GitHub Actions

00:11:11.740 --> 00:11:12.520
atau Azure DevOps

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:13.700
hanya butuh beberapa menit.

00:11:14.260 --> 00:11:14.820
Kirim perubahan

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:15.600
ke repository Anda,

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:16.760
dan sistem akan otomatis

00:11:16.760 --> 00:11:17.820
membangun image kontainer baru,

00:11:18.060 --> 00:11:19.460
mengirimnya ke Azure Container Registry,

00:11:19.620 --> 00:11:20.200
lalu memperbarui

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:21.300
deployment Anda di AKS

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:22.780
tanpa langkah manual,

00:11:22.980 --> 00:11:24.060
tanpa perlu SSH ke server.

00:11:24.380 --> 00:11:25.000
Semuanya otomatis.

